    "summary": "Pair of moccasins made of tanned black leather, cotton, synthetic fabric and plastic beadwork.The sole is crafted from a single piece of leather, the seam at the heel, crimped at the toe to allow attachment to the vamp. The vamp is decorated with plastic beadwork - a circular design in blue and grey. The edge of the vamp is crudely overstitched in blue thread. A collar of black leather is attached around the ankle. The moccasin has a synthetic, fleece like, fabric lining.",
